{"id":23397,"section":"officeHoldings","title":"Marsha McLean — City Council Member, The City of Santa Clarita","status":"live","holdingPerson":["#23085 Marsha McLean"],"holdingOffice":["#18327 City Council Member"],"holdingBody":["#394 The City of Santa Clarita"],"termStart":"December 2018","termStartEdtf":"2018-12","termEnd":"December 2022","termEndEdtf":"2022-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"roster","endEvidence":"derived","footnotes":[{"col1":"1","col2":"Elected on November 6, 2018, second of 15 candidates for 3 seats, with 25,273 votes.","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"1","note":"Elected on November 6, 2018, second of 15 candidates for 3 seats, with 25,273 votes.","source":"editorial-2026"},{"col1":"2","col2":"The roster gives Marsha McLean 2002—. Leon Worden, \"Santa Clarita City Council 1987—\", the council ledger on SCVHistory.com, carried on the page for LW3149 (archive record #4967).","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"2","note":"The roster gives Marsha McLean 2002—. Leon Worden, \"Santa Clarita City Council 1987—\", the council ledger on SCVHistory.com, carried on the page for LW3149 (archive record #4967).","source":"editorial-2026"},{"col1":"3","col2":"The term's end is derived: the seat was next filled at the election of November 8, 2022. Terms turn over in December: Cameron Smyth left the council on 10 December 2024.","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"3","note":"The term's end is derived: the seat was next filled at the election of November 8, 2022. Terms turn over in December: Cameron Smyth left the council on 10 December 2024.","source":"editorial-2026"}],"editorNotes":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"heading":null,"note":null,"position":null}],"recordProvenance":"council_winners_and_terms.php, 29 September 2026","recordDates":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"col4":null,"col5":null,"printed":null,"iso":null,"granularity":null,"label":null,"confirmed":null,"col6":null,"rejected":null}]}
{"id":23395,"section":"officeHoldings","title":"Marsha McLean — City Council Member, The City of Santa Clarita","status":"live","holdingPerson":["#23085 Marsha McLean"],"holdingOffice":["#18327 City Council Member"],"holdingBody":["#394 The City of Santa Clarita"],"termStart":"April 2014","termStartEdtf":"2014-04","termEnd":"December 2018","termEndEdtf":"2018-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"roster","endEvidence":"derived","footnotes":[{"col1":"1","col2":"Elected on April 8, 2014, second of 13 candidates for 3 seats, with 5,677 votes.","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"1","note":"Elected on April 8, 2014, second of 13 candidates for 3 seats, with 5,677 votes.","source":"editorial-2026"},{"col1":"2","col2":"The roster gives Marsha McLean 2002—. Leon Worden, \"Santa Clarita City Council 1987—\", the council ledger on SCVHistory.com, carried on the page for LW3149 (archive record #4967).","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"2","note":"The roster gives Marsha McLean 2002—. Leon Worden, \"Santa Clarita City Council 1987—\", the council ledger on SCVHistory.com, carried on the page for LW3149 (archive record #4967).","source":"editorial-2026"},{"col1":"3","col2":"The term's end is derived: the seat was next filled at the election of November 6, 2018, after the city moved its elections to November, which extended the April term beyond four years. Terms turn over in December: Cameron Smyth left the council on 10 December 2024.","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"3","note":"The term's end is derived: the seat was next filled at the election of November 6, 2018, after the city moved its elections to November, which extended the April term beyond four years. Terms turn over in December: Cameron Smyth left the council on 10 December 2024.","source":"editorial-2026"}],"editorNotes":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"heading":null,"note":null,"position":null}],"recordProvenance":"council_winners_and_terms.php, 29 September 2026","recordDate