{"id":23333,"section":"officeHoldings","title":"Carl Boyer — City Council Member, The City of Santa Clarita","status":"live","holdingPerson":["#15808 Carl Boyer"],"holdingOffice":["#18327 City Council Member"],"holdingBody":["#394 The City of Santa Clarita"],"termStart":"December 15, 1987","termStartEdtf":"1987-12-15","termEnd":"April 1990","termEndEdtf":"1990-04","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"retrospective","endEvidence":"roster","footnotes":[{"col1":"1","col2":"Elected on 3 November 1987, fourth of 26 candidates for the five seats of the first council (City Clerk, Historical Election Results). The council took office on 15 December 1987 (Santa Clarita Valley Magazine, Winter 1987-88, archive record #4967).","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"1","note":"Elected on 3 November 1987, fourth of 26 candidates for the five seats of the first council (City Clerk, Historical Election Results). The council took office on 15 December 1987 (Santa Clarita Valley Magazine, Winter 1987-88, archive record #4967).","source":"editorial-2026"},{"col1":"2","col2":"The first council's terms were staggered: the three who stood again in April 1990 and the two who stood in April 1992. Carl Boyer's seat was on the 1990 ballot. The roster gives Carl Boyer 1987-1998. Leon Worden, \"Santa Clarita City Council 1987—\", the council ledger on SCVHistory.com, carried on the page for LW3149 (archive record #4967).","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"2","note":"The first council's terms were staggered: the three who stood again in April 1990 and the two who stood in April 1992. Carl Boyer's seat was on the 1990 ballot. The roster gives Carl Boyer 1987-1998. Leon Worden, \"Santa Clarita City Council 1987—\", the council ledger on SCVHistory.com, carried on the page for LW3149 (archive record #4967).","source":"editorial-2026"}],"editorNotes":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"heading":null,"note":null,"position":null}],"recordProvenance":"council_winners_and_terms.php, 29 September 2026","recordDates":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"col4":null,"col5":null,"printed":null,"iso":null,"granularity":null,"label":null,"confirmed":null,"col6":null,"rejected":null}]}
{"id":23331,"section":"officeHoldings","title":"Buck McKeon — City Council Member, The City of Santa Clarita","status":"live","holdingPerson":["#18791 Buck McKeon"],"holdingOffice":["#18327 City Council Member"],"holdingBody":["#394 The City of Santa Clarita"],"termStart":"December 15, 1987","termStartEdtf":"1987-12-15","termEnd":"April 1992","termEndEdtf":"1992-04","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"expired","startEvidence":"retrospective","endEvidence":"roster","footnotes":[{"col1":"1","col2":"Elected on 3 November 1987, first of 26 candidates for the five seats of the first council (City Clerk, Historical Election Results). The council took office on 15 December 1987 (Santa Clarita Valley Magazine, Winter 1987-88, archive record #4967).","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"1","note":"Elected on 3 November 1987, first of 26 candidates for the five seats of the first council (City Clerk, Historical Election Results). The council took office on 15 December 1987 (Santa Clarita Valley Magazine, Winter 1987-88, archive record #4967).","source":"editorial-2026"},{"col1":"2","col2":"The first council's terms were staggered: the three who stood again in April 1990 and the two who stood in April 1992. Buck McKeon's seat was on the 1992 ballot. The roster gives Buck McKeon 1987-1992. Leon Worden, \"Santa Clarita City Council 1987—\", the council ledger on SCVHistory.com, carried on the page for LW3149 (archive record #4967).","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"2","note":"The first council's terms were staggered: the three who stood again in April 1990 and the two who stood in April 1992. Buck McKeon's seat was on the 1992 ballot. The roster gives Buck McKeon 1987-1992. Leon Worden, \"Santa Clarita City Council 1987—\", the council ledger on SCVHistory.com, carried on the page for LW3149 (archive record #4967).","source":"editorial-2026"}],"editorNotes":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"heading":null,"note":null,"position":null}],"recordProvenance":"council_winners_an