{"id":23317,"section":"officeHoldings","title":"Bill Miranda — City Council Member, The City of Santa Clarita","status":"live","holdingPerson":["#23089 Bill Miranda"],"holdingOffice":["#18327 City Council Member"],"holdingBody":["#394 The City of Santa Clarita"],"termStart":"2017","termStartEdtf":"2017","termEnd":"December 2018","termEndEdtf":"2018-12","selectionMethod":"appointed","howEnded":"expired","startEvidence":"roster","endEvidence":"derived","footnotes":[{"col1":"1","col2":"Appointed. The roster gives Bill Miranda \"2017—\"; he won no election before November 2018, and the vacancy is the seat Dante Acosta left in 2016 for the State Assembly. He was elected to a full term on November 6, 2018. Leon Worden, \"Santa Clarita City Council 1987—\", the council ledger on SCVHistory.com, carried on the page for LW3149 (archive record #4967).","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"1","note":"Appointed. The roster gives Bill Miranda \"2017—\"; he won no election before November 2018, and the vacancy is the seat Dante Acosta left in 2016 for the State Assembly. He was elected to a full term on November 6, 2018. Leon Worden, \"Santa Clarita City Council 1987—\", the council ledger on SCVHistory.com, carried on the page for LW3149 (archive record #4967).","source":"editorial-2026"}],"editorNotes":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"heading":null,"note":null,"position":null}],"recordProvenance":"council_winners_and_terms.php, 29 September 2026","recordDates":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"col4":null,"col5":null,"printed":null,"iso":null,"granularity":null,"label":null,"confirmed":null,"col6":null,"rejected":null}]}
{"id":22420,"section":"officeHoldings","title":"TimBen Boydston — City Council Member, The City of Santa Clarita","status":"live","holdingPerson":["#21946 TimBen Boydston"],"holdingOffice":["#18327 City Council Member"],"holdingBody":["#394 The City of Santa Clarita"],"termStart":"April 2012","termStartEdtf":"2012-04","termEnd":"December 2016","termEndEdtf":"2016-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"expired","startEvidence":"certified","endEvidence":"derived","footnotes":[{"col1":"1","col2":"Resolution No. 12-9, Section 4: \"Bob Kellar was elected as member of the City Council for the full term of four years; and TimBen Boydston was elected as member of the City Council for the full term of four years.\" The resolution is document #21936.","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"1","note":"Resolution No. 12-9, Section 4: \"Bob Kellar was elected as member of the City Council for the full term of four years; and TimBen Boydston was elected as member of the City Council for the full term of four years.\" The resolution is document #21936.","source":"editorial-2026"},{"col1":"2","col2":"The resolution gives a term of four years. The city then moved its elections to November, the seat was next filled at the election of November 8, 2016, and terms turn over in December, so the term ran to December 2016. The end is derived; the start is certified.","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"2","note":"The resolution gives a term of four years. The city then moved its elections to November, the seat was next filled at the election of November 8, 2016, and terms turn over in December, so the term ran to December 2016. The end is derived; the start is certified.","source":"editorial-2026"}],"editorNotes":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"heading":null,"note":null,"position":null}],"recordProvenance":"import_elections.php, 29 September 2026","recordDates":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"col4":null,"col5":null,"printed":null,"iso":null,"granularity":null,"label":null,"confirmed":null,"col6":null,"rejected":null}]}
{"id":22418,"section":"officeHoldings","title":"Bob Kellar — City Council Member, The City of Santa Clarita","status":"live","holdingPerson":["#21944 Bob Kellar"],"holdingOffice":["#18327 City Council Member"],"holdingBody":["#394 The City of Santa Clarita"],"termStart":"April 2012","termStartEdtf":"2012-04","termEnd":"December 2016","termEndEdtf":"2016-12","selectionMethod":"elected","howEnded":"reelected","startEvidence":"certified","endEvidence":"derived","footnotes":[{"col1":"1","col2":"Resolution No. 12-9, Section 4: \"Bob Kellar was elected as member of the City Council for the full term of four years; and TimBen Boydston was elected as member of the City Council for the full term of four years.\" The resolution is document #21936.","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"1","note":"Resolution No. 12-9, Section 4: \"Bob Kellar was elected as member of the City Council for the full term of four years; and TimBen Boydston was elected as member of the City Council for the full term of four years.\" The resolution is document #21936.","source":"editorial-2026"},{"col1":"2","col2":"The resolution gives a term of four years. The city then moved its elections to November, the seat was next filled at the election of November 8, 2016, and terms turn over in December, so the term ran to December 2016. The end is derived; the start is certified.","col3":"editorial-2026","number":"2","note":"The resolution gives a term of four years. The city then moved its elections to November, the seat was next filled at the election of November 8, 2016, and terms turn over in December, so the term ran to December 2016. The end is derived; the start is certified.","source":"editorial-2026"}],"editorNotes":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"heading":null,"note":null,"position":null}],"recordProvenance":"import_elections.php, 29 September 2026","recordDates":[{"col1":null,"col2":null,"col3":null,"col4":null,"col5":null,"printed":null,"iso":null,"granularity":null,"label":null,"confirmed":null,"col6":null,"rejected":null}]}
